<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-microsoft-com:office:office'
      xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-microsoft-com:office:word'
      xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>API 명세서</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', '맑은 고딕', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #1e293b;
    margin: 40px;
  }
  h1 {
    color: #0f172a;
    font-size: 22pt;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #6366f1;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  h2 {
    color: #1e1b4b;
    font-size: 16pt;
    background-color: #f1f5f9;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-left: 4px solid #6366f1;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  h3 {
    color: #334155;
    font-size: 13pt;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  p, li {
    font-size: 10.5pt;
    color: #334155;
  }
  table {
    border-collapse: collapse;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #e2e8f0;
    color: #0f172a;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  tr:nth-child(even) {
    background-color: #f8fafc;
  }
  pre, code {
    font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;
    background-color: #0f172a;
    color: #f8fafc;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 12px;
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    display: block;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-all;
    margin: 12px 0;
  }
  .meta-table {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .meta-table td {
    border: none;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    background: transparent !important;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>익명 방명록 웹 애플리케이션 RESTful API 명세서</h1>
<table class="meta-table">
  <tr><td><b>버전:</b> v1.0</td><td><b>규격:</b> REST API (JSON)</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>Base URL:</b> http://localhost:8080/api/v1</td><td><b>문서 상태:</b> 최종본</td></tr>
</table>

<hr/>

<h2>1. 공통 사양 (Common Specifications)</h2>
<h3>1.1 Content-Type</h3>
<p>모든 요청 및 응답 본문은 <code>application/json</code> 포맷을 사용합니다.</p>

<h3>1.2 HTTP 상태 코드 (HTTP Status Codes)</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>코드</th><th>상태</th><th>설명</th></tr>
  <tr><td>200 OK</td><td>성공</td><td>요청 처리 성공</td></tr>
  <tr><td>201 Created</td><td>생성됨</td><td>새 리소스(글/답글) 생성 완료</td></tr>
  <tr><td>400 Bad Request</td><td>잘못된 요청</td><td>필수 파라미터 누락 또는 유효성 검사 실패</td></tr>
  <tr><td>401 Unauthorized</td><td>인증 실패</td><td>비밀번호 불일치로 인한 수정/삭제 거부</td></tr>
  <tr><td>404 Not Found</td><td>리소스 없음</td><td>해당 ID의 게시글 또는 답글이 존재하지 않음</td></tr>
  <tr><td>500 Internal Server Error</td><td>서버 오류</td><td>서버 내부 장애 발생</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>2. 방명록 API (Guestbook Entries Endpoints)</h2>

<h3>2.1 방명록 목록 조회 (GET /api/v1/entries)</h3>
<p>등록된 방명록 목록을 조회합니다. (Query Parameters: search, sort, page, limit)</p>
<pre><code>[GET] /api/v1/entries?search=민우&sort=latest

Response (200 OK):
{
  "status": "success",
  "total": 1,
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "entry-seed-1",
      "author": "민우",
      "avatar": "🎨",
      "content": "방명록 메시지입니다.",
      "isPrivate": false,
      "likes": 12,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-08T04:56:00.000Z",
      "replies": []
    }
  ]
}</code></pre>

<h3>2.2 비밀글 본문 조회 (POST /api/v1/entries/:id/unlock)</h3>
<p>비밀번호 확인을 통해 비밀글의 실제 본문을 조회합니다.</p>
<pre><code>[POST] /api/v1/entries/entry-seed-2/unlock
Request Body:
{
  "password": "비밀번호입력"
}

Response (200 OK):
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "id": "entry-seed-2",
    "content": "이 글은 원래 비밀글의 실제 본문 내용입니다!"
  }
}</code></pre>

<h3>2.3 방명록 작성 (POST /api/v1/entries)</h3>
<pre><code>[POST] /api/v1/entries
Request Body:
{
  "author": "홍길동",
  "password": "password1234",
  "avatar": "🚀",
  "content": "방명록 남기고 갑니다!",
  "isPrivate": false
}

Response (201 Created):
{
  "status": "success",
  "message": "방명록이 등록되었습니다.",
  "data": { "id": "entry-1723001234567", "author": "홍길동" }
}</code></pre>

<h3>2.4 방명록 수정 (PUT /api/v1/entries/:id)</h3>
<pre><code>[PUT] /api/v1/entries/entry-1723001234567
Request Body:
{
  "password": "password1234",
  "content": "수정된 내용입니다."
}

Response (200 OK):
{
  "status": "success",
  "message": "방명록이 수정되었습니다."
}</code></pre>

<h3>2.5 방명록 삭제 (DELETE /api/v1/entries/:id)</h3>
<pre><code>[DELETE] /api/v1/entries/entry-1723001234567
Request Body:
{
  "password": "password1234"
}

Response (200 OK):
{
  "status": "success",
  "message": "방명록이 정상적으로 삭제되었습니다."
}</code></pre>

<h2>3. 답글 API (Replies Endpoints)</h2>

<h3>3.1 답글 작성 (POST /api/v1/entries/:entryId/replies)</h3>
<pre><code>[POST] /api/v1/entries/entry-seed-1/replies
Request Body:
{
  "author": "답글이",
  "password": "replypassword123",
  "content": "좋은 글이네요!"
}</code></pre>

<h3>3.2 답글 수정 (PUT /api/v1/entries/:entryId/replies/:replyId)</h3>
<pre><code>[PUT] /api/v1/entries/entry-seed-1/replies/reply-123
Request Body:
{
  "password": "replypassword123",
  "content": "수정된 답글입니다."
}</code></pre>

<h3>3.3 답글 삭제 (DELETE /api/v1/entries/:entryId/replies/:replyId)</h3>
<pre><code>[DELETE] /api/v1/entries/entry-seed-1/replies/reply-123
Request Body:
{
  "password": "replypassword123"
}</code></pre>

</body>
</html>